          superlatives, no luxury language. Typography pairs <strong>Fraunces</strong> display
          serif with <strong>Source Sans 3</strong> for interface and operational text. The
          palette anchors on Lantern Black, Deep Pine, and Parchment with Cider, Cranberry, and
          Wheat accents. The site targets WCAG 2.2 AA conformance.
        </p>

